#: 6aa70ef3505f45bbabc201639da83bb0
msgid "90"
msgstr "90"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:574
#: 3a4a63831d374b32ae5e2a3b7c0ffad9
