msgstr "190"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:581
#: f12879ba2b8d45e6935ebdd000cb004b
msgid ""
"To verify that your transmitter behaves similarly, you may want to perform a"
" test to ensure that a valid USB power value is returned for each switch "
"position. View the `3DR CHDK Tester script here "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/3DRCHDKTester.txt>`__."
" Copy the contents into a text editor and save as **3DRCHDKTester.bas**. "
"Load into your (unlocked) SD card by copying the file into the **Scripts** "
"folder (in the **CHDK** folder)."
msgstr ""
"为验证您的发射机行为是否类似，可进行测试以确保每个开关位置都返回有效的 USB 供电值。`查看 3DR CHDK 测试脚本 "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/other_files/3DRCHDKTester.txt>`__，将内容复制到文本编辑器中保存为"
" **3DRCHDKTester.bas**。将文件复制到 **Scripts** 文件夹（位于 **CHDK** 文件夹中），加载到已解锁的 SD "
"卡上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:589
#: 5f0cf8c46c7248a5a801c470ffb1589b
msgid "Configuring CHDK cable for Testing"
msgstr "配置 CHDK 线缆以进行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:591
#: 9d779148ce6a45b4b20daa00962c0f41
msgid ""
"Before we can test the CHDK cable, we'll need to choose a channel for camera"
" control and configure the corresponding inputs. Connect your plane's "
"autopilot to Mission Planner. Go to **Configuration \\| Radio Calibration** "
"to locate an available channel and its corresponding switch on your RC "
"transmitter. (We'll use channel 7.) Check the PWM outputs for the up, mid, "
"and down positions of the channel. Compare them with the table shown above."
msgstr ""
"测试 CHDK 线缆前，需要选择一个相机控制通道并配置相应输入。将飞控连接到 Mission Planner，前往 "
"**Configuration（配置）\\| Radio Calibration（遥控校准）**，找到可用通道及其在遥控发射机上对应的开关（此处使用通道"
" 7）。检查该通道高位、中位和低位的 PWM 输出值，并与上表进行比较。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:599
#: c3a500f2a2e1434bb79ad775bd892e5b
msgid ""
"Before we disconnect the autopilot, we need to change an important parameter"
" that you'll be using often. Under **Configuration** -> **Standard "
"Parameters**, scroll about 4/5 of the way down to find the **Servo out "
"function** parameters for each channel. Find the parameter that corresponds "
"to your camera control channel. For us, it's **Servo out function "
"(SERVO7_FUNCTION or RC7_FUNCTION)**."
msgstr ""
"断开飞控连接前，需要修改一个重要参数。在 **Configuration（配置）** -> **Standard Parameters（标准参数）** "
"下，向下滚动约 4/5 处，找到每个通道的 **Servo out function（舵机输出功能）** "
"参数，找到与相机控制通道对应的参数，对我们而言是 **Servo out function (SERVO7_FUNCTION or "
"RC7_FUNCTION)**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:606
#: 55fe45e4b953411ab96238eec05b1e46
msgid ""
"***Set this parameter to Manual whenever you want to control your camera "
"using your RC transmitter; set to Disabled when you want the autopilot to "
"control the camera automatically.***"
msgstr "***使用遥控发射机控制相机时，将此参数设为 Manual（手动）；希望飞控自动控制相机时，设为 Disabled（禁用）。***"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:610
#: 76548ecc4ea34a88864eb2ec7aa2f024
msgid ""
"Since we're using the RC transmitter to test the CHDK cable, set **Servo out"
" function** to **Manual**. Select Write Params before disconnecting your "
"autopilot."
msgstr ""
"由于使用遥控发射机测试 CHDK 线缆，将 **Servo out function（舵机输出功能）** 设为 "
"**Manual（手动）**。断开飞控连接前选择 Write Params（写入参数）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:614
#: f8e649e046e549d99b12548419786fc9
msgid ""
"Once you've chosen your camera control channel, you'll need to connect your "
"CHDK cable to the autopilot's output pins. Connect either of the pin "
"connectors on the CHDK cable to the autopilot output pins corresponding to "
"your camera control channel (black cable on the outside). For example, we "
"connected our CHDK cable to the channel 7 output pins on the autopilot. Make"
" sure no input pins are connected for that channel."
msgstr ""
"选定相机控制通道后，需将 CHDK 线缆连接到飞控的输出引脚。将 CHDK "
"线缆的任一引脚连接器连接到对应相机控制通道的飞控输出引脚（黑色线缆朝外）。例如，我们将 CHDK 线缆连接到飞控的通道 7 "
"输出引脚。确保该通道没有连接任何输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:628
#: be98fe8ff89c41479bbff330502e848c
msgid ""
"Connect the CHDK cable to the camera's USB port. Turn the camera on, load "
"the \\ **3DRCHDKTester.bas** script (by selecting **Load Script from File** "
"from the main CHDK menu), and press the shutter button to run the test "
"script."
msgstr ""
"将 CHDK 线缆连接到相机的 USB 接口，开机后加载 \\ **3DRCHDKTester.bas** 脚本（从 CHDK 主菜单选择 **Load"
