msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:653
#: 5d66821c850746d986464efc9d203a65
msgid ""
"**Problem**: The tester script runs but does not display any output on the "
"camera screen."
msgstr "**问题**：测试脚本运行但相机屏幕上未显示任何输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:656
#: 657fd61382b546419cb7d4bf8f9ad1de
msgid ""
"Cause 1: Do you have the parameter SERVOx_FUNCTION=1 ir RCx_FUNCTION=1 for "
"manual override of the RC channel you are using? You can see both the PWM "
"input and output on the **Configuration \\| Failsafes** screen in the "
"Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"原因 1：是否为所用 RC 通道设置了参数 SERVOx_FUNCTION=1 或 RCx_FUNCTION=1 以手动覆盖？可在 Mission "
"Planner 的 **Configuration（配置）\\| Failsafes（失控保护）** 界面查看 PWM 输入和输出值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:661
#: 4d200417487c4d0f8a98b13da79123d0
msgid ""
"Cause 2: Is your output rail powered? Even if you are getting the correct "
"PWM signal out on your camera control channel, the output needs 5V DC. You "
"can power the output rail with a jumper on JP1 as shown, which bridges the "
"input power to the output, or by directly running power to the output."
msgstr ""
"原因 2：输出轨道是否供电？即使相机控制通道输出了正确的 PWM 信号，输出端仍需要 5V 直流电。可在 JP1 "
"上添加跳线（如图所示）将输入电源连接到输出端，或直接向输出端供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-chdk-camera-control-tutorial.rst:667
#: ca512ffc4273410aa50a45676601939e
msgid ""
"Cause 3: Do you have the remote enabled in CHDK? In the CHDK menus: Remote "
"parameters > enable remote. Leave the other remote settings as is."
msgstr "原因 3：CHDK 中是否启用了遥控？在 CHDK 菜单中：遥控参数 > 启用遥控。其他遥控设置保持不变。"
